        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ce70e334-bab2-54bd-b3a4-58fbc04330b4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christopher Walken, Allison Williams, Taylor Louderman, Lilla Crawford, Rob Morrison, Élan Luz Rivera\n- Productions: Peter Pan Live!, Peter Pan, The Deer Hunter, Sunny Day\n- Places: Grumman Studios, Bethpage, New York\n- Roles: Captain Hook, Wendy, Sunny, Doodle, Rox, Blair, Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Taylor Louderman appeared as Wendy in NBC's live production of the musical \"Peter Pan.\"\n- Peter Pan Live! featured a live production of the 1954 musical adaptation of \"Peter Pan\" televised from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York.\n- Allison Williams starred in Peter Pan Live! in the title role.\n- Christopher Walken portrayed Captain Hook in Peter Pan Live!.\n- Christopher Walken won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for portraying Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich in \"The Deer Hunter.\"\n- Sunny Day centers on Sunny, voiced by Lilla Crawford, a hairdresser who runs her own salon.\n- In Sunny Day, Sunny is helped by her talking dog Doodle, voiced by Rob Morrison, hair colourist Rox, voiced by Élan Luz Rivera, and receptionist Blair, voiced by Taylor Louderman.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "877ab6c4-989a-5d17-9656-26cfa856591f",
        "text": "Page: Peter Pan Live!. Sentence: The special featured a live production of the 1954 musical adaptation of \"Peter Pan\", televised from Grumman Studios in Bethpage, New York, starring Allison Williams in the title role and Christopher Walken as Captain Hook.\nPage: Christopher Walken. Sentence: Walken has received a number of awards and nominations during his career, including winning the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for his portrayal of Nikanor \"Nick\" Chebotarevich in \"The Deer Hunter.\"\nPage: Taylor Louderman. Sentence: In 2013, she appeared as Wendy in NBC's live production of the musical \"Peter Pan\".\nPage: Sunny Day (TV series). Sentence: The series revolves around Sunny (voiced by Lilla Crawford), a hairdresser who runs her own salon with the help of her talking dog Doodle (Rob Morrison), hair colourist Rox (Élan Luz Rivera), and receptionist Blair (Taylor Louderman).",
